# The price memory the suite reads (codexledger/pricesV1): once the bank has been seen, today's
# prices of what the account holds are remembered and saved with the ledger, at logout at the
# latest. JSON quotes cannot be written in a check, so the prices are matched by value.
#
# Facts (RuneLite's gameval ItemID): ABYSSAL_WHIP "Abyssal whip", SHARK "Shark", COINS "Coins".
# The prices are made up. The scene is schematic, not the real map.

scene 3200 3200
item ABYSSAL_WHIP "Abyssal whip" price 1500000
item SHARK "Shark" price 800
item COINS "Coins" price 1 stacks
items INV SHARK 10
items INV COINS 100000 stacked
at 3222 3218
login
tick 12

items BANK ABYSSAL_WHIP 1
items BANK SHARK 500 stacked
tick 5
state LOGIN_SCREEN
tick 2
expect saved.pricesV1 ~ version
expect saved.pricesV1 ~ :1500000}
expect saved.pricesV1 ~ :800,
